# Drop zone for your own copy of New Star Soccer 5.
#
# This directory is tracked by git so that it exists in a fresh clone with its
# instructions intact; its CONTENTS are not. The pattern is the one used by
# HarbourMasters/Shipwright for roms/ and by zeldaret/oot for baseroms/.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!checksums.json
